  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup olive oil",
    "0.25 cup chopped fresh parsley",
    "1 lemon, juiced",
    "2 tablespoons hot pepper sauce",
    "3 cloves garlic, minced",
    "1 tablespoon tomato paste",
    "2 teaspoons dried oregano",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "2 pounds large shrimp, peeled and deveined with tails attached",
    "6 skewers"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/W2oRdAmQ6fmjj-mUdYEmVbRGYMo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19484-grilled-marinated-shrimp-VAT-005-step-01-f4d91ce0aa774a7fa98347dc62e69272.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19484/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk olive oil, parsley, lemon juice, hot pepper sauce, garlic, tomato paste, oregano, salt, and black pepper together in a mixing bowl. Reserve a small amount for basting later.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TWPkiFiYNKcngoomaOeGc8ctICY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19484-grilled-marinated-shrimp-VAT-006-step-02-ee416cac61d04ee58f7d833d8a411e3e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19484/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour remaining marinade into a large resealable plastic bag; add shrimp, coat with the marinade, squeeze out excess air, and seal the bag. Marinate shrimp in the refrigerator for 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZHEq0-GJ5mZabpHZxi4qQLo3VEk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19484-grilled-marinated-shrimp-VAT-008-step-03-B-70013e9b2dc04e27906921c7e617711d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19484/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat a grill to medium-low heat. Thread shrimp onto skewers, piercing once near the tail and once near the head. Discard any remaining marinade.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2MNU3GDm3EUEW4dACfpc-XfIXMI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19484-grilled-marinated-shrimp-VAT-009-step-04-eb6aa00644d64427bf01624178dad0c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19484/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly oil the grill grate. Cook shrimp until opaque, about 5 minutes per side, basting frequently with reserved marinade.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/t-nLSnfjfjBA_jjomM4chAqteJw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19484-grilled-marinated-shrimp-VAT-010-step-05-f15262463b1547a7b1b171ff8147dbad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19484/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/giUSHmcTAa66ZqK-XKtm9Gvl3h0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19484-grilled-marinated-shrimp-VAT-003-4x3-88c0f0bf74424957880de02a48e41cb9.jpg"
      ],
